    <bpmn:process id="W_W4988" name="W4988. Contractor Background, Reference &amp; Quality-Capability Due Diligence" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Candidate vetting (W4987); tier upgrade; quality issue
Frequency: Per candidate + event-driven
Volume: ~100–200 DDs per year (per candidate) × network
Owner: Pro-Referral Network Manager / TPRM (VS-161) / Quality (VS-31)
Participants: TPRM (VS-161), Background Screening (VS-167), Quality (VS-31), Legal (VS-100), Field Sales (VS-140)
Source: workflow W4988 — Contractor Background, Reference &amp; Quality-Capability Due Diligence</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4988_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4988_Lane1" name="TPRM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4988_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4988_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4988_Lane2" name="Quality">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4988_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4988_Lane3" name="Network Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4988_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4988_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4988_Start5" name="Candidate vetting (W4987); tier upgrade; quality issue">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4988_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4988_Task6" name="Conduct background &amp; reference checks: business reputation, references from…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Conduct background &amp; reference checks: business reputation, references from past clients/suppliers (links VS-167 screening), financial standing, legal/disputes/court records, sanctions/exclusion (links VS-161 TPRM, VS-86), and ethics/integrity (VS-119/VS-131)
Responsible (R): TPRM / Screening / Legal / Network Manager
Accountable (A): Network Manager
Duration: Per candidate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4988_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4988_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4988_Task7" name="Assess quality &amp; technical capability: portfolio/previous-work review…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Assess quality &amp; technical capability: portfolio/previous-work review, trade-skill assessment, workmanship quality, capacity/equipment, and (where relevant) a pilot/qualification project; align to the trade standard (links VS-31 quality, VS-123 trade skill)
Responsible (R): Quality / Network Manager / Field Sales
Accountable (A): Network Manager
Duration: Per candidate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4988_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4988_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4988_Task8" name="Decide &amp; document: vetting decision (accept/tier/decline), document the DD…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Decide &amp; document: vetting decision (accept/tier/decline), document the DD file, set the tier (W4989) and probation/monitoring if accepted, and feed the scorecard (W5003) baseline
Responsible (R): Network Manager / TPRM / Quality
Accountable (A): Network Manager
Duration: Per candidate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4988_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4988_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4988_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4988_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-746 (ensure controlled execution — Installer/Contractor Network Strategy, Recruitment &amp; Vetting (PA-172.1).) | - CTL-746: background/reference checks completed; sanctions screened; quality assessed; decision documented
Owner: Pro-Referral Network Manager / TPRM (VS-161) / Quality (VS-31)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
