    <bpmn:process id="W_W4990" name="W4990. Pro-Referral Marketplace Platform, Profile &amp; Catalog Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Onboarding (W4989); profile/catalog update; platform change
Frequency: Per installer + continuous updates
Volume: ~300–500 installer profiles in the network; catalog by trade/service
