Participants: IT (VS-27), Marketplace (VS-95), Digital Commerce (VS-10), Marketing (VS-14), Installer
Source: workflow W4990 — Pro-Referral Marketplace Platform, Profile &amp; Catalog Management</bpmn:documentation>
