        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Manage the pro-referral marketplace platform: the customer-facing &quot;Find-a-Pro&quot; experience (web/app/store-kiosk links VS-10/VS-75), the installer directory/search, the request→match flow (W4994), ratings/reviews display (W5001), and integration with ecommerce/services (VS-10/VS-12)
Responsible (R): IT / Marketplace / Digital / Network Manager
Accountable (A): GM, Digital Commerce Inc. / COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4990_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4990_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4990_Task7" name="Build &amp; maintain installer profiles/catalog: per-installer profile (trade…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Build &amp; maintain installer profiles/catalog: per-installer profile (trade, area, services, rate card, certifications, portfolio, rating), the service catalog (standardized service offerings/SKUs — links VS-12), photo/portfolio assets (VS-137 DAM), and accuracy/freshness
Responsible (R): Network Manager / Marketplace / Installer / DAM
Accountable (A): Network Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4990_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4990_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4990_Task8" name="Govern platform quality &amp; content: profile/catalog accuracy, prevent…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern platform quality &amp; content: profile/catalog accuracy, prevent false/misleading listings, manage reviews (W5001) for authenticity (RA 10173 consent, fake-review control links VS-125), and the content/brand standard (VS-14)
Responsible (R): Marketplace / Network Manager / Legal / Marketing
Accountable (A): GM, Digital Commerce Inc. / COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4990_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
