    <bpmn:process id="W_W4991" name="W4991. Trade-Coverage Gap Analysis, Geographic Expansion &amp; Recruitment Targeting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Periodic review; expansion (VS-37); referral-unfulfilled pattern
Frequency: Quarterly
Volume: ~1 coverage analysis across 200 trade-areas × trade specialties
Owner: Pro-Referral Network Manager / Strategy / Analytics
Participants: Analytics (VS-28), Strategy (VS-33), Store Ops (VS-07), Field Sales (VS-140), Trade Program (VS-43)
Source: workflow W4991 — Trade-Coverage Gap Analysis, Geographic Expansion &amp; Recruitment Targeting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4991_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4991_Lane1" name="Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4991_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4991_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4991_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4991_Lane2" name="Strategy">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4991_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4991_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4991_Start4" name="Periodic review; expansion (VS-37); referral-unfulfilled pattern">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4991_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4991_Task5" name="Analyze coverage &amp; gaps: per trade-area/specialty, the installer count/capacity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Analyze coverage &amp; gaps: per trade-area/specialty, the installer count/capacity vs referral demand (from W4994/W4996), the fill-rate, response/completion times, and unfulfilled-referral patterns; identify under-covered trades/areas
Responsible (R): Analytics / Network Manager / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4991_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4991_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4991_Task6" name="Target recruitment &amp; expansion: prioritize gaps by demand/value (links VS-37…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Target recruitment &amp; expansion: prioritize gaps by demand/value (links VS-37 store expansion, VS-140 field sales coverage), set recruitment targets (W4986), and align with regional/store expansion
Responsible (R): Strategy / Network Manager / Field Sales
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4991_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4991_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4991_Task7" name="Track &amp; adjust: monitor coverage/fill-rate improvement, adjust targets, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Track &amp; adjust: monitor coverage/fill-rate improvement, adjust targets, and feed network strategy (W4985) and the store-opening plan (VS-37)
Responsible (R): Analytics / Network Manager / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4991_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4991_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4991_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4991_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-746 (ensure controlled execution — Installer/Contractor Network Strategy, Recruitment &amp; Vetting (PA-172.1).) | - CTL-746: quarterly coverage analysis; gaps prioritized; recruitment targeted; expansion aligned
Owner: Pro-Referral Network Manager / Strategy / Analytics</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
